1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,200
Man: Hi, I'm calling about the apartment for rent on Kramer Avenue.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,663
Woman: Yes, I am the owner.

3
00:00:09,663 --> 00:00:12,080
It'll be available at the end of the month

4
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:17,050
One bedroom, street parking only, one month deposit required.

5
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,891
Man: Great. I'd like to come look at it now.

6
00:00:19,891 --> 00:00:25,290
One thing I forgot to mention in the advertisement is that there are no pets allowed in the building.

7
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:28,070
Man: Oh, that's a problem.

8
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:33,200
Woman: I'm sorry. I really should add that information to the listing.
